				<u>Lg.</u>
				927b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Princeton Exp.Inscr.</u>
				7871.3
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Syria</span>), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. διαφερόντως τὸν ἀδελφόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
